      "widgets_values": [
        "## Region Genie: SD1.5\n\nSD1.5 has no layout format: the Separate button ties each prompt to its region by attention (it turns on by itself).\n\nThe image size is 512 × 512, SD1.5's own.\n\n**Model files** (pick your own in the loaders if yours are named differently):\n- [v1-5-pruned-emaonly-fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/stable-diffusion-v1-5-archive/resolve/main/v1-5-pruned-emaonly-fp16.safetensors) → `models/checkpoints`\n\nManual: https://github.com/TheGhostOfSmittyWerbenjagermanjensen/ComfyUI-Region-Genie"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
